ders gid via id/getent (cmd-35577b7debe5496c)","Captured pre-restart baseline: boot_id, uptime, directory perms (cmd-584574ff187244fd), and file-level perms/contents via sudo sh -c stat/cat (cmd-c69ea6fd84bb4644)","Issued backgrounded 'shutdown -r now' via sudo -n so the acknowledgement returned before disconnection (cmd-54c354cd67254538)","Confirmed node1 was unreachable immediately after the restart command (cmd-679a5a663ccc41a7)","Polled node1 until exec succeeded again and captured new boot_id/uptime proving the restart occurred (cmd-7dbccbc4644b4799)","Re-verified post-restart ownership, permissions, file contents, and inventorysvc/inventory-readers identities (cmd-ada4ff1aa02d4e47)"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Existing data in /srv/inventory owned by inventorysvc, group-readable by inventory-readers, inaccessible to others, with contents preserved","command_ids":["cmd-ebcadee11d8044c2","cmd-1cb9a192ec1841a6","cmd-35577b7debe5496c","cmd-c69ea6fd84bb4644"],"summary":"Baseline showed root:root 755/644 with no inventorysvc user or inventory-readers group. After creating the user/group and applying chown + chmod (750 dirs / 640 files), ls/stat show inventorysvc:inventory-readers ownership with no 'other' permission bits, and records.csv/config.json content is byte-identical to the original."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart evidence: healthy baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered state","command_ids":["cmd-584574ff187244fd","cmd-c69ea6fd84bb4644","cmd-54c354cd67254538","cmd-679a5a663ccc41a7","cmd-7dbccbc4644b4799","cmd-ada4ff1aa02d4e47"],"summary":"Pre-restart boot_id e4e401d2-3dd8-48c6-848a-545631b9e229 captured alongside healthy ownership/perms/content of /srv/inventory. A backgrounded 'sudo shutdown -r now' returned its acknowledgement before the node dropped (confirmed unreachable in the next call). Polling later succeeded with a new boot_id dc308602-8027-499d-a591-ebeb571a79f6, proving an actual restart. Post-restart check